WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The shared offset cancels in distances, but not in directions from the origin.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Moving an activation inside a fixed model is not just renaming coordinates.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Projection can erase the feature that carries the label.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Geometric invariance does not guarantee an unchanged downstream answer.
